  m_Name: ModePreview_Cleave
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Mode: 39
  Notes: The four intensities are four unrelated ARENAS, not four sizes of one -
    Panes / Swell / Cage / Twistbands, one CellConfigDataSO each, so there are
    exactly four entries here and the preview genuinely changes place with the
    intensity row. SpawnRingRadiusFloor is set by author_preview_spawns.py from
    the scene's own ServerPlayerVesselInitializer, and it is LOAD-BEARING because
    this cell has NO NUCLEUS (nucleus radius reads 0, so the computed ring would
    collapse to the cell centre - inside the arena the player is meant to attack
    from outside). The floor mirrors the scene's SCALAR, which is sized for the
    2,160-radius rungs; rungs 3 and 4 are 720, so the preview opens further out on
    those two than a match does. Re-run author_preview_spawns.py after any change
    to the scene's spawn ring.
